### Todo API Tests
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or similar

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071

### =====================
### GET ALL TODOS
### =====================

### Get all todo items (should be empty initially)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todoitems
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =====================
### CREATE TODOS
### =====================

### Create first todo item
POST {{baseUrl}}/todoitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Learn Azure Functions",
    "isComplete": false
}

###

### Create second todo item
POST {{baseUrl}}/todoitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Deploy to Azure",
    "isComplete": false
}

###

### Create third todo item (already complete)
POST {{baseUrl}}/todoitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Setup local development",
    "isComplete": true
}

###

### =====================
### GET TODOS
### =====================

### Get all todo items
GET {{baseUrl}}/todoitems
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get todo by ID (replace {id} with actual ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get completed todos only
GET {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/complete
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =====================
### UPDATE TODO
### =====================

### Update todo item (mark as complete)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Learn Azure Functions",
    "isComplete": true
}

###

### =====================
### DELETE TODO
### =====================

### Delete todo item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### =====================
### ERROR CASES
### =====================

### Get non-existent todo (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/9999
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update non-existent todo (should return 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Non-existent",
    "isComplete": false
}

###

### Delete non-existent todo (should return 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todoitems/9999
Content-Type: application/json

